{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Full Steam, take control of Scrapper and fight for your freedom in this 2D, side-on, endless runner. Bust free from the iron grip of the tyrannous overlord in a ruthless steampunk world. Survive the pandemonium and battle through hordes of volatile enemies, collecting experience to upgrade your rig from tin shell, to battle hardened. Keep up the pace, or the Steam King will catch you and bring your rebellion to a devastating end. This re-imagination of a tried and true classic, incorporates survivor like elements to the endless runner genre.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047380?t=1759897181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047380?t=1759897181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047380/3dd3282f462291b9191e774507634b739b8ff1d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759897181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047380/3dd3282f462291b9191e774507634b739b8ff1d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759897181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Full Steam, take control of Scrapper and fight for your freedom in this 2D, side-on, endless runner. Bust free from the iron grip of the tyrannous overlord in a ruthless steampunk world. Survive the pandemonium and battle through hordes of volatile enemies, collecting experience to upgrade your rig from tin shell, to battle hardened. Keep up the pace, or the Steam King will catch you and bring your rebellion to a devastating end. This re-imagination of a tried and true classic, incorporates survivor like elements to the endless runner genre.</p>","developers":["FoundTree Studios"],"genre